WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:01.490
Healthy tension, right?

2
00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:02.610
We need it in our lives.

3
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:04.530
We need it in our
physical journey.

4
00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:08.130
And whether you realize it or not,
you need it in your spiritual

5
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:13.170
journey. God uses tension
to get your attention,

6
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:18.370
and healthy tension is what
just strengthens and deepens

7
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.490
our faith. And that's
a beautiful thing.

8
00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:26.050
Some days it may not feel good,
some days it may not be

9
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.300
easy, but just remember
this: what challenges you

10
00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.810
is what changes you.

11
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:35.170
So just keep stacking
these spiritual reps.

12
00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:39.170
Get this quality time with
God and fuel your soul.

13
00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:43.490
And I promise you, it will show
up in the workouts of life.

14
00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:45.090
Thank you for joining me today.

15
00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.930
If I could pray for you, do not
hesitate to send me your prayer

16
00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.930
request. You know I
love to get those.

17
00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:53.330
I will see you on
your next workout.

18
00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:54.610
Let me close our time.

19
00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:56.150
Lord, thank you.

20
00:00:58.010 --> 00:00:59.890
Thank you, Lord.
Thank you for tension.

21
00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:04.660
Thank you not for the chaotic,
unhealthy tension that we see in

22
00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:06.960
this world. Lord, thank you
for the healthy tension.

23
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.590
The tension between where we are
today, God, and where you would

24
00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:13.040
have us to go.

25
00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:18.490
The tension that helps strengthen,
deepen, and grow our faith.

26
00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:23.210
And so today, Lord, we just
want to lean into that and learn

27
00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:25.210
to be strong in your grace.

28
00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.134
In Jesus' name, amen.

